<title>JAPAN: TOKYO BOURSE SUSPENDS MITSUI CONSTRUCTION SHARES.</title>
<headline>TOKYO BOURSE SUSPENDS MITSUI CONSTRUCTION SHARES.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo Stock Exchange (TSE) said on Wednesday it was suspending trading in shares of Mitsui Construction Co Ltd for the rest of the session.  </p>
<p>The reason for the suspension is to clarify information regarding Mitsui Construction's restructuring plan, the TSE said in a statement.</p>
<p>Just before the TSE announced the suspension, Mitsui Construction's shares had risen to 170 yen from Tuesday's 159 yen close.</p>
